  "question": {
    "text": "What volume of hydrogen in ml will be liberated at STP by the reaction of Zn on 50 ml of dilute <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> of specific gravity 1.3 having purity of 40%?<br />\rReport your answer by rounding it upto nearest whole number."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6000",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Mass of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn><mtext>&nbsp;g</mtext></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mn>98</mn><mtext>&nbsp;g</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mtext>&nbsp;1&nbsp;mole</mtext></mrow></munder></mrow></munder><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mn>22.4</mn><mtext>&nbsp;L</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mtext>&nbsp;NTP</mtext></mrow></munder></mrow></munder></math><br /><br />As 98 gm <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> provides <math><mo>=</mo><mn>22.4</mn><mtext>&nbsp;L&nbsp;</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />So 26 gm <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> provides <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>22.4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>26</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>98</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>5.95</mn><mtext>&nbsp;L</mtext></math><br /><br /><math><mo>≈</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext>&nbsp;L</mtext></math>"
  }
